  "itemUsage": {
    "en": "Vendela, a florist who survived when war came. Now doing what she can to rebuild her little greenhouse.",
    "zh": "在战争中幸存的花店店长刺玫，正试着重新搭建自己的小温室。",
    "source": "official",
    "isMachineTranslation": false
  },
  "itemDesc": {
    "en": "If you happen to run across her napping on a clear afternoon, don't say anything. Do as she does, and close your eyes. Feel the sunlight on them.",
    "zh": "如果恰好遇上在明媚午后打盹的她，别出声，不妨也学着她闭上眼感受阳光。",
    "source": "official",
    "isMachineTranslation": false
  },
